  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palm Oil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDH is working in Colombia, India, Indonesia, Malaysia, and Nigeria in partnership with private sector, civil society organization and Government to implement the principle of sustainable palm oil supply chain. These interventions aim to strengthen the competitiveness of palm oil commodities from producer countries in the international market, enhance the welfare of smallholders/workers, supporting climate change adaptation/mitigation, and preserving natural resources for generations to come. In addition, our interventions also aim to address the implications of the new EUDR policy to the palm oil supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
